      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm working on a policy draft for a museum board about how we handle artifacts that were collected during colonial periods. we need to decide if we should start a repatriation program or keep things where they are as part of a 'universal museum' concept. can you help me draft a section that outlines the different viewpoints on this so we can show we've considered everything?",
